enum Result:
    Ok as Int
    Error as String
end

age is 21
Sayln match age:
    adult @ 18..:
        adult
    _:
        0
end

result is Result::Ok(7)
Sayln match result:
    whole @ Result::Ok(payload @ 0..10):
        payload
    whole @ Result::Ok(_):
        0
    whole @ Result::Error(_):
        0
end

values is [1, 2, 3]
Sayln match values:
    whole @ [head, ...tail]:
        head + tail[0]
    []:
        0
end
